    "description": "Sanyu Co., Ltd. produces and sells steel products in Japan. The company offers polished steel bars, including carbon steel for machine construction, sulfur and sulfur-compound free cutting steel, and alloy steel; cold heading steel wires comprising carbon, boron, and alloy steel wires; and cold-rolled steel bars. It also provides bicycle parts, rotating shafts for electrical products; shaft materials for industrial machinery; printing and spinning machines, rail materials for automated equipment; cylinder rods for hydraulic and pneumatic equipment; construction machinery parts, press molds, turbine shafts for hydroelectric and thermal power generators; rotating shafts for pumps and motors; sewing machine parts and furniture; and bolts, nuts, rivets, small screws, tapping screws, and other types of screws, as well as cold-forged parts for automobiles, bicycles, and industrial equipment. Sanyu Co., Ltd. was incorporated in 1957 and is headquartered in Hirakata, Japan."
